# Fe and deuterium in a cubic cell (P 1). Fixture for
# test_cif_reader_symmetry.cpp: site D1 has the type symbol D, deuterium,
# which gemmi reads as an element and Tadah does not have (its elements are
# H to Og), as in COD's neutron-diffraction entries.
data_FeD_deuterium_site
_cell_length_a 3.0
_cell_length_b 3.0
_cell_length_c 3.0
_cell_angle_alpha 90
_cell_angle_beta 90
_cell_angle_gamma 90
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
Fe1 Fe 0 0 0
D1 D 0.5 0.5 0.5
